# ByByte Blockly

Before editing `src/app/modules/blockly/`, **read the skill**:

`.cursor/skills/bybyte-blockly/SKILL.md`

## Required

- Category colours: `CATEGORY_PALETTE` (hue), not `#hex`.
- New robot/platform blocks → `platforms/<pack>/`; universal hardware → `definitions/<domain>/`.
- Platform Pack: boards → profiles → categories → blocks; register in `platforms/index.ts`.
- Do not change legacy block type IDs.
- After changes: `npm run build:web`.

## Do not without explicit request

- Git commit/push.
- Remove `console.log` in `blockly-editor.component.ts`.
- Robot Otto / Robot ByByte: use `hiddenBoardIds` from `robot-boards.const.ts`; do not use `requiredBoardIds` on robot containers.

